    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67341" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μηκ-άς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">άδος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bleating one</i>, in <i><span class="en">
